# XDG fallback only. `core.excludesfile` in .gitconfig overrides this path
# entirely, so ~/.gitignore_global is the live owner of global ignore rules and
# is not mirrored here. These two rules are the minimum a machine still needs
# when core.excludesfile is absent: they keep agent-local settings and notes out
# of every repository. Everything else lives with the owner.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/CLAUDE.local.md
